# DDR内存简介

[DDR SDRAM](https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=2689211&content_type=Article&match_order=1&q=DDR+SDRAM&zhida_source=entity)全称为Double Data Rate Synchronized DRAM，中文名为“双倍数据流SDRAM”；

**内存（采样）IO频率*2（上下边沿采样）=数据传输率（频率）；**

**DDR每次传输64bit（8B），因此带宽=数据传输率*8B；**

DDR位宽是内存总线位宽（等于CPU寻址宽度或位数），芯片位宽是指存储位元的宽度（x4、x8、x16）；

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%201.png)

此处时钟是IO时钟，即采样时钟频率；

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%202.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%203.png)

**channel、DIMM、rank**是板级接口/模块：

**1个channel插2个DIMM**，是2个DIMM以ping-pong方式共享1个channel；

**1个DIMM设置2个 Rank**，是为了增加DIMM的内存容量，或增加channel的内存密度；

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%204.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%205.png)

**channel**是CPU接收内存数据的通道，即DDR总线；

**DIMM**是Dual-Inline-Memory-Modules，封装后的产品内存条；

**rank**称为内存列，一组内存颗粒的芯片位宽（n）组成DDR总线位宽（64bit），称为一个rank；每个rank接收命令独立，1个channel内的rank共享DDR总线；

chip、bank、row/column是die上概念：

**chip**是内存颗粒，即单个内存芯片，其DQ引脚个数等于芯片位宽；

**bank**是内存芯片中存储位元阵列，为降低sense amplifier的成本排列成阵列**array**，逻辑上bank是一个大阵列，实际由多个子阵列（**sub-array**）组成；

**row**是位元阵列的不同字/page，对应字选线word select line/行地址；

**column**是位元阵列的不同位/列地址，对应位选线bit select line/列地址；

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%206.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%207.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%208.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%209.png)

**多channel、Bank interleave、overlock**

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2010.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2011.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2012.png)

**内存颗粒Chip结构**

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2013.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2014.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2015.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2016.png)

**读写时先激活行地址（RAS）后激活列地址（CAS）；**

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2017.png)

**burst方式用于串行化prefetch数据；**

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2018.png)

每个阵列地址对应多个存储位元（bit），所以**列地址线的部分位不用于地址设置，而用于设置burst order**，即**将prefetch数据串行IO的顺序；**

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2019.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2020.png)

# DRAM原理和结构

**存储位元存储1bit数据；信号增强器SAP辅助存储；**

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2021.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2022.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2023.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2024.png)

**存储位元数组**

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2025.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2026.png)

**存储位元阵列**

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2027.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2028.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2029.png)

直接的，存储位元只存储1bit，被1组地址（Bank、Row、Column）编址；

为了减少SAP开销同时增大内存容量，**让1组地址（Bank、Row、Column）编址n bit数据，对应n个存储位元，定义为地址单元Cell，n是Cell位宽/芯片位宽；**

**增大芯片位宽（n）到4bit，用相同地址编址这些位，称为1个Cell，列地址从5个减小成3个。**

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2030.png)

**逻辑上Cell中存储位元紧密排布，Bank是Cell组成的一个大阵列；**

**实际上Bank由多个子阵列组成，Cell中存储位元平分到每个子阵列；**

**prefetch、burst和bank interleave（多bank流水）等技术扩展存储位元规模，增大内存容量，同时提高IO频率和数据传输率，但DDR颗粒的核心时钟频率没有改变；**

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2031.png)

假设DDR总线位宽**64bit，芯片位宽**4bit，则**16个DDR4颗粒组成rank对应总线位宽；**

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2032.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2031.png)

16GB的DIMM设置16个8x4的8Gb颗粒；

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2019.png)

8GB的DIMM设置8个8x8的8Gb颗粒；

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2033.png)

4GB的DIMM设置4个8x16的8Gb颗粒；

**DDR4内存条最大容量**

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2034.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%2035.png)

