**DDR4到DDR5**

[https://www.alliancememory.com/wp-content/uploads/AllianceMemory_16Gb_DDR4_AS4C1G16D4-062BCN_BIN_Ver2.0_Aug2024.pdf](https://www.alliancememory.com/wp-content/uploads/AllianceMemory_16Gb_DDR4_AS4C1G16D4-062BCN_BIN_Ver2.0_Aug2024.pdf)

**DDR4**的8n-prefetch，BL=8，每个DIMM是64bit的单通道；

**DDR5**的16n-prefetch，BL=16，每个DIMM是32bit的双通道，来匹配cache line大小64Byte，即**每个Rank映射2个channel**；

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%20100.png)

