每个die是**8Gbit**，**未达最大颗粒密度**

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%20103.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%20104.png)

每个die是**16Gbit**，**达最大颗粒密度**

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%20105.png)

![image.png](%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E3%80%81%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%E9%80%9F%E8%A7%88/image%20106.png)

每个die是**16Gbit**，**未达最大颗粒密度**

